@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001/api
@token =
@deliveryType = DeliveryToCustomer
@deliveryId = 0
@version = replace-with-the-version-returned-by-the-editor

### Load an existing delivery editor (type: DeliveryToCustomer, DeliveryToStock or DeliveryFromStock)
GET {{baseUrl}}/deliveries/{{deliveryType}}/{{deliveryId}}/edit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preview validation and pallet factor without persisting any changes
POST {{baseUrl}}/deliveries/{{deliveryType}}/{{deliveryId}}/edit/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "{{version}}",
  "deliveryDate": "2026-11-12",
  "nrOfItems": 200,
  "nrOfPallets": 2,
  "palletLength": 1200,
  "palletWidth": 800,
  "palletHeight": 1000,
  "palletIsStackable": false,
  "palletCalcFactor": 1,
  "isDelivered": true
}

### Save delivery details immediately, independently of the transport order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/deliveries/{{deliveryType}}/{{deliveryId}}/edit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "{{version}}",
  "deliveryDate": "2026-11-12",
  "nrOfItems": 200,
  "nrOfPallets": 2,
  "palletLength": 1200,
  "palletWidth": 800,
  "palletHeight": 1000,
  "palletIsStackable": false,
  "palletCalcFactor": 1,
  "isDelivered": true,
  "spcsRefNr": "Reference",
  "supplierInvoiceNr": 1234,
  "confirmedStockTakingDate": null
}

### Invalid delivery type returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/deliveries/invalid/0/edit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing delivery returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/deliveries/DeliveryToStock/0/edit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}